# Strings that must never appear in a committed fixture.
# Copy to .capture-identity (gitignored) and add your own.
#
# Git identity is checked automatically, but that is often a personal address while the
# thing that leaks is a work username — a real Columbia UNI sat in six fixtures in this
# repo and no git-identity check could have matched it.
#
# One per line. Four characters minimum, so short strings cannot match half the file.
#
# df2832
# yourname@columbia.edu
